    "text": "Me suke to \u00fee.\nOs meum aperui et attraxi ipsum, \u00feu opnedest \u00fein bon ond drowe me to \u00fee.\nWalawa ond wa is me, \u00feet ic efre com to \u00fee.\nFor noldest \u00feu mid \u00feine mu\u00fee bim\u00e6nen \u00feine neode, ac efre digelliche \u00feu woldest ham bidernan.\nNoldest \u00feu ham siggen biforen none preosten, \u00feer sunfule men seche\u00fe ham ore, bim\u00e6ne\u00fe hore misdeden\n\u00deurh so\u00fee bireousunge \u00feeo soule reste onfo\u00fe.\nAc ne \u00feearf ic nefre resten \u00feurh \u00feine bireousunge, ac altog\u00e6dere ic am forloren \u00feurh \u00feine lu\u00feere deden.\nNoldest \u00feu mid mu\u00fee bidden me none miltse.\nNu \u00feu ert adumbed ond dea\u00fe haue\u00fe \u00fee keige.\nMid clutes \u00feu ert forbunden ond lo\u00fe alle freonden, Efre ma eft on to lokienne.\n\u00deus is reouliche \u00fein si\u00fe efter \u00fein wrecche lif.\nFor \u00feu were biset \u00feicke mid sunne, ond alle sunnen weren prikiende so piles on ile.\nHe bi\u00fe \u00feicke mid piles, ne prikie\u00fe heo hine nowiht, for al bi\u00fe \u00feet softe iwend to him sulfen, \u00feet ne\nFor al bi\u00fe \u00feet scearpe him iwend fromward.\nSo \u00feu were mid sunne iset al wi\u00feinne.\n\u00deeo sunfule pikes prikie\u00fe me ful sore.\nAc al \u00feet softe was iwend to \u00fee suluen, Ond efre \u00feet scerpe scorede me touward, heo weren iwend so\nIc was mid \u00feine prickunge ipined ful sore.\nAc nu me wulle\u00fe prikien \u00feeo pikes inne helle, pinien me ful sore, all for \u00feine synne.\nIc was on heihnesse isceapen ond soule ihoten.\nIc was \u00fee seoue\u00fee isceaft, so \u00feeo bec segge\u00fe, \u00fee \u00fee almihti god mildeliche iwrouhte, wisliche mid\n\u00deis beo\u00fe \u00feeo seouene, \u00fee ic \u00e6r fore seide.\n\u00deis was makunge \u00fe\u00e6s almihties f\u00e6der, of \u00feissen andweorke alle \u00feing he iwrouhte.\nOnd \u00feus hit is iwriten on holie wisdome, Fiat, et facta sunt omnia, he seide, Iwur